      "comment": "Makhaira: Faramarz and the Fall of Badanah",
      "content": "Badanah was a tyrant vassal king whose greed Faramarz, his son, and Makhaira judged ruinous. Makhaira killed him with her sword dance and the pair arranged for him to appear to have fallen from a tower while pursuing a falcon. The tower was demolished and his hunting falcons were buried with him. Faramarz was crowned, lost and regained the throne several times, and was finally exiled to the forest after killing her.",
