      "comment": "Makhaira: Thoth's Riddles",
      "content": "Thoth, held in ruins sealed by King Deshret's rules, offered three humans a riddle and a power. Makhaira was the second; she answered about vengeance and was granted the power to be loved. Her story is told on a slab that Alhaitham and Kaveh read in Headlong Into the Sands.",
